TMAT placeholder for Export Runtime Baseline.

This source-control fixture documents the intended material contract for the
baseline project. The export helper and asset compiler path should replace this
text fixture with a binary TMAT before packaging a runnable build.

runtimeSlots:
	albedo: Assets/Textures/Baseline.tetf
	normal: Assets/Textures/Baseline.tetf
	roughness: Assets/Textures/Baseline.tetf
	metallic: Assets/Textures/Baseline.tetf
	emissive: Assets/Textures/Baseline.tetf
